// The cutscene state, clock, layer and wind sites follow the FPSLocker
// dynamic patch for this build
// (https://github.com/masagrator/FPSLocker-Warehouse). Its frame-time
// measurement is rebuilt here with a 1/60 to 1/30 s clamp.
// Byte-verified against the IDB.
